s identification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Wildlife GIS & Spatial Ecology"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Wildlife","GIS","Remote Sensing","Statistics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This is a particularly strong future-ready specialization."},{"type":"h","text":"6. Human-Wildlife Conflict"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conflict mapping"},{"text":"Wildlife movement"},{"text":"Community interaction"},{"text":"Mitigation strategies"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Research Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Zoology","Research / Field Intern","Field Research Assistant","M.Sc Wildlife Science / Ecology","Project Associate / Researcher","Ph.D.","Wildlife Research Scientist","Senior Research Scientist","Principal Scientist / Research Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"Conservation Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Zoology","Conservation Intern","Field Officer / Project Assistant","Conservation Researcher","Senior Conservation Scientist","Program Lead","Conservation Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"GIS & Data Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Zoology","Wildlife Data / GIS Intern","GIS & Ecology Analyst","Spatial Ecologist","Senior Ecological Data Scientist","Conservation Analytics Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI & Wildlife Conservation"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can increasingly support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Camera-trap image classification"},{"text":"Species recognition"},{"text":"Individual animal identification"},{"text":"Acoustic species detection"},{"text":"Population monitoring"},{"text":"Anti-poaching analytics"},{"text":"Habitat prediction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Computer Vision"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OpenCV"},{"text":"Image classification"},{"text":"Object detection"},{"text":"Deep learning fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A powerful combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Camera Trap","Computer Vision","Species Detection","Ecological Analysis"]},{"type":"h","text":"Bioacoustics"},{"type":"p","text":"Machine learning can analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bird calls"},{"text":"Mammal calls"},{"text":"Bat echolocation"},{"text":"Ecosystem soundscapes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Drones & Remote Sensing"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Habitat surveys"},{"text":"Population counts"},{"text":"Landscape mapping"},{"text":"Vegetation monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental DNA (eDNA)"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of using environmental samples for biodiversity monitoring."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc Zoology"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Wildlife Biology"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Ecology"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Conservation Biology"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Animal Behaviour"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Field Survey Methods"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Species Identification"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Wildlife Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"R Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"GIS / QGIS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Remote Sensing"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Scientific Writing"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Research Methodology"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"AI / Computer Vision"}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By the end of B.Sc, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong zoology fundamentals"},{"text":"Strong ecology knowledge"},